### 查询服务工单
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/services/jobs/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","serviceJobId":"job-001"}

### 取消服务工单
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/services/jobs/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","serviceJobId":"job-001","query":{"cancellationReasonCode":"CUSTOMER_CANCELLED"}}

### 完成服务工单
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/services/jobs/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","serviceJobId":"job-001"}

### 查询服务工单列表
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/services/jobs/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","query":{"pageSize":"10"}}

### 创建服务预约
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/services/appointments/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","serviceJobId":"job-001","body":{"appointmentStartTime":"2026-08-10T09:00:00Z","appointmentEndTime":"2026-08-10T10:00:00Z"}}

### 改约服务预约
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/services/appointments/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","serviceJobId":"job-001","appointmentId":"appointment-001","body":{"appointmentStartTime":"2026-08-11T09:00:00Z","appointmentEndTime":"2026-08-11T10:00:00Z"}}

### 分配预约资源
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/services/appointments/resources/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","serviceJobId":"job-001","appointmentId":"appointment-001","body":{"resources":[]}}

### 设置预约履约数据
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/services/appointments/fulfillment/set
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","serviceJobId":"job-001","appointmentId":"appointment-001","body":{}}

